# Lesson 38 TODO — Present continuous (now vs every day)

Do **not** turn Present Continuous into another packed grammar block (L34 and L37 already preview it).

Give it a **separate lesson** with:

- a very small vocabulary set (a few daily verbs only)
- a lot of speaking with the teacher
- a clear contrast, repeated throughout:

```
I work every day.
I am working now.
```

Keep the rest of the unit textbooks (`Vote for me!`, `A quiet life?`) for later lessons.
